       Identification Division.                                         00010009
       Program-ID. F115ISR0.                                            00020009
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030009
      *################################################################*00040009
      *                                                                 00050009
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060009
      *                                                                 00070009
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Sys_Code_Rel.     00080009
      *                                                                 00090009
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100009
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110009
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120009
      *                                                                 00130009
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140009
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150009
      *                                                                 00160009
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170009
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180009
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190009
      *                                                                 00200009
      *                                                                 00210009
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220009
      *                                                                 00230009
      *    Initialize                          R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    00240009
      *    Set   R115ISR0-Version        To    True                     00250009
      *    Set   R115ISR0-In-Select      To    True                     00260009
      *    Move  &from sys-type          To    R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type 00270009
      *    Move  &from sys-code          To    R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code 00280009
      *    Move  &to sys-type            To    R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type   00290009
      *    Move  &to sys-code            To    R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code   00300009
      *    Move  &relation-type          To    R115ISR0-In-Rel-Type     00310009
      *                                                                 00320009
      *    Call  'F115ISR0'              Using R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    00330009
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00340009
      *    End-Call                                                     00350009
      *                                                                 00360009
      *    Evaluate True                                                00370009
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00380009
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00390009
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00400009
      *                                                                 00410009
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00420009
      *        ...not found...                                          00430009
      *                                                                 00440009
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00450009
      *        ...found...                                              00460009
      *                                                                 00470009
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00480009
      *                                                                 00490009
      *################################################################*00500009
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00510009
