       A000-Main                         Section.                       02650009
      *                                                                 02660009
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      02670009
      *                                                                 02680009
           Evaluate True                                                02690009
             When SW-IA-Initialize                                      02700009
               Continue                                                 02710009
