           Goback.                                                      02800009
      *################################################################*02810009
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02820009
      *                                                                 02830009
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02840009
      *                                                                 02850009
           Evaluate True                                                02860009
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02870009
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02880009
             When Other                                                 02890009
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           02900009
           End-Evaluate                                                 02910009
      *                                                                 02920009
           Compute  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab                                    02930009
               =    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Table             02940009
               /    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Row               02950009
