             When Not R115X000-Version                                  03110009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    03120009
               Move  'GL-VERSION-INVALID'                               03130009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03140009
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03150009
               Move  R115X000-Version-No To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03160009
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)03170009
               Move  'R115X000'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)03180009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03190009
