           .                                                            04660009
      *################################################################.04670009
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       04680009
      *                                                                 04690009
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  04700009
      *                                                                 04710009
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           04720009
      *                                                                 04730009
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-From-Type            Not = Space                    04740018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-From-Type (1:1)      Not = '%'                      04750018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-From          To    True                     04760018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       04770018
KUTT  *                                                                 04780018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-From-F-I-Id          Not = +0                       04790018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-From          To    True                     04800018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       04810018
KUTT  *                                                                 04820018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-From-Contr-Type      Not = Spaces                   04830018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-From-Contr-Type (1:1)                               04840018
KUTT  *                                  Not = '%'                      04850018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-From          To    True                     04860018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       04870018
KUTT  *                                                                 04880018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-From-Code            Not = Space                    04890018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-From-Code (1:1)      Not = '%'                      04900018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-From          To    True                     04910018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       04920018
KUTT  *                                                                 04930018
KUTT  * ... then                                                        04940018
KUTT  *                                                                 04950018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-To-Type              Not = Space                    04960018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-To-Type (1:1)        Not = '%'                      04970018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-To            To    True                     04980018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       04990018
KUTT  *                                                                 05000018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-To-F-I-Id            Not = +0                       05010018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-To            To    True                     05020018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       05030018
KUTT  *                                                                 05040018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-To-Contr-Type        Not = Spaces                   05050018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-To-Contr-Type (1:1)  Not = '%'                      05060018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-To            To    True                     05070018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       05080018
KUTT  *                                                                 05090018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-To-Code              Not = Space                    05100018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-To-Code (1:1)        Not = '%'                      05110018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-To            To    True                     05120018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       05130018
KUTT  *                                                                 05140018
KUTT  *    If  W-DB-Rel-Type             Not = Space                    05150018
KUTT  *    and W-DB-Rel-Type (1:1)       Not = '%'                      05160018
KUTT  *        Set  Sw-Use-Relation      To    True                     05170018
KUTT  *    End-If                                                       05180018
KUTT  *                                                                 05190018
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id          Not = +0                       05200018
               Set  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst      To    True                     05210018
           End-If                                                       05220018
      *                                                                 05230018
           If  W-DB-From-Type            Not = Space                    05240018
           and W-DB-From-Type (1:1)      Not = '%'                      05250018
               Set  Sw-Use-ST-Type       To    True                     05260018
               Move  Length              Of    W-DB-From-Type           05270018
                                         To    W-Pos                    05280018
               If  W-DB-From-Type (W-Pos:1)                             05290018
                                         =     '%'                      05300018
               or  W-DB-To-Type (W-Pos:1)                               05310018
                                         =     '%'                      05320018
                   Set  Sw-Use-ST-Type-Like                             05330018
                                         To    True                     05340018
               End-If                                                   05350018
           End-If                                                       05360018
      *                                                                 05370018
           If  W-DB-Rel-Type             Not = Space                    05380018
           and W-DB-Rel-Type (1:1)       Not = '%'                      05390018
               Set  Sw-Use-Relation      To    True                     05400018
               Move  Length              Of    W-DB-Rel-Type            05410018
                                         To    W-Pos                    05420018
               If  W-DB-Rel-Type (W-Pos:1)                              05430018
                                         =     '%'                      05440018
                   Set  Sw-Use-Relation-Like                            05450018
                                         To    True                     05460018
               End-If                                                   05470018
           End-If                                                       05480018
      *                                                                 05490018
           If  W-DB-From-Code            Not = Space                    05500018
           and W-DB-From-Code (1:1)      Not = '%'                      05510018
               Set  Sw-Use-SC-Code       To    True                     05520018
               Move  Length              Of    W-DB-From-Code           05530018
                                         To    W-Pos                    05540018
               If  W-DB-From-Code (W-Pos:1)                             05550018
                                         =     '%'                      05560018
      *        We use LIKE on To-Code anyway, no need to specify that   05570018
      *        or  W-DB-To-Code (W-Pos:1)                               05580018
      *                                  =     '%'                      05590018
                   Set  Sw-Use-SC-Code-Like                             05600018
                                         To    True                     05610018
               End-If                                                   05620018
           End-If                                                       05630018
      *                                                                 05640018
           If  WE-From-Contr-Type        Not = Spaces                   05650019
           and WE-From-Contr-Type (1:1)  Not = '%'                      05660019
               Set  Sw-Use-SC-Contr-Type To    True                     05670018
           End-If                                                       05680018
      *                                                                 05690018
           Evaluate True                                                05700009
KUTT  *      When SW-Use-Asc                                            05710018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-Fr-Asc                                         05720018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-To-Asc                                         05730018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-Re-Asc                                         05740018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-Fr-To-Asc                                      05750018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-Fr-Re-Asc                                      05760018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-To-Re-Asc                                      05770018
KUTT  *      or   SW-Use-Fr-To-Re-Asc                                   05780018
             When SW-Use-Fi-ST-Asc                                      05790018
             or   SW-Use-Fi-ST-Re-Asc                                   05800018
             or   SW-Use-Fi-ST-SC-Asc                                   05810018
             or   SW-Use-Fi-ST-Re-SC-Asc                                05820018
               Continue                                                 05830009
      *                                                                 05840009
             When other                                                 05850009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05860009
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05870009
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05880009
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05890009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05900009
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05910009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05920009
      *                                                                 05930009
           End-Evaluate                                                 05940009
      *                                                                 05950009
           .                                                            05960009
      *################################################################.05970009
       D400-Count-Cursor                 Section.                       05980009
      *                                                                 05990009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  06000009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     06010009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Count-Cursor                               06020009
                                         To    True                     06030009
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ISRS-Cursor-Code     06040009
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ISRS-DB-Key          06050009
      *                                                                 06060009
           Call  'F115ISRR'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  06070009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       06080009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06090009
           End-Call                                                     06100009
      *                                                                 06110009
           Evaluate True                                                06120009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06130009
               Move  R115ISRS-Out-Total-Rows                            06140009
                                         To    WC-Total-No-Of-Rows      06150009
      *                                                                 06160009
             When other                                                 06170009
               Move  'D401'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06180009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06190009
      *                                                                 06200009
           End-Evaluate                                                 06210009
      *                                                                 06220009
           .                                                            06230009
      *################################################################.06240009
       D500-Open-Cursor                  Section.                       06250009
      *                                                                 06260009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  06270009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     06280009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Open-Cursor To    True                     06290009
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ISRS-Cursor-Code     06300009
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ISRS-DB-Key          06310009
      *                                                                 06320009
           Call  'F115ISRR'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  06330009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       06340009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06350009
           End-Call                                                     06360009
      *                                                                 06370009
           Evaluate True                                                06380009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06390009
               Set   WS-Cursor-OK        To    True                     06400009
      *                                                                 06410009
             When other                                                 06420009
               Move  'D501'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06430009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06440009
      *                                                                 06450009
           End-Evaluate                                                 06460009
      *                                                                 06470009
           .                                                            06480009
      *################################################################.06490009
       E000-Get-Next                     Section.                       06500009
      *                                                                 06510009
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   06520009
           Perform E100-Check-Qualification                             06530009
           Perform E200-Fetch-Cursor                                    06540009
      *                                                                 06550009
           If  R7919999-Return-OK                                       06560009
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06570009
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06580009
           End-If                                                       06590009
      *                                                                 06600009
           .                                                            06610009
      *################################################################.06620009
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       06630009
      *                                                                 06640009
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         06650009
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     06660009
      * the Get-1st.                                                    06670009
      *                                                                 06680009
           Evaluate True                                                06690009
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06700009
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06710009
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          06720009
               Continue                                                 06730009
      *                                                                 06740009
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06750009
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06760009
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         06770009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06780009
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06790009
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06800009
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06810009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06820009
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06830009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06840009
      *                                                                 06850009
             When Other                                                 06860009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06870009
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06880009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06890009
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06900009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06910009
      *                                                                 06920009
           End-Evaluate                                                 06930009
      *                                                                 06940009
           .                                                            06950009
      *################################################################.06960009
       E200-Fetch-Cursor                 Section.                       06970009
      *                                                                 06980009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  06990009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     07000009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               07010009
                                         To    True                     07020009
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ISRS-Cursor-Code     07030009
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ISRS-DB-Key          07040009
      *                                                                 07050009
           Call  'F115ISRR'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  07060009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       07070009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07080009
           End-Call                                                     07090009
      *                                                                 07100009
           Evaluate True                                                07110009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07120009
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                07130009
      *                                                                 07140009
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07150009
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     07160009
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       07170009
                 Then                                                   07180009
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    07190009
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              07200009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07210009
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07220009
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07230009
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           07240009
                 Else                                                   07250009
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    07260009
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07270009
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07280009
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07290009
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           07300009
               End-If                                                   07310009
      *                                                                 07320009
             When other                                                 07330009
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07340009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07350009
      *                                                                 07360009
           End-Evaluate                                                 07370009
      *                                                                 07380009
           .                                                            07390009
      *################################################################.07400009
       F000-Select                       Section.                       07410009
      *                                                                 07420009
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           07430009
      *                                                                 07440009
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       07450009
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               07460009
      *                                                                 07470009
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        07480009
      *                                                                 07490009
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     07500009
      *                                                                 07510009
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         07520009
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 07530009
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  07540009
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   07550009
           End-If                                                       07560009
      *                                                                 07570009
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       07580009
      *                                                                 07590009
           Evaluate True                                                07600009
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  07610009
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       07620009
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 07630009
      *                                                                 07640009
             When other                                                 07650009
               Move FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM    To    WD-Fin-Inst-Id           07660018
      *                                                                 07670009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    07680009
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07690009
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07700009
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07710009
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)07720009
               String WD-Fin-Inst-Id           Delimited by space       07730018
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07740018
                      FK-TFST-Type-From        Delimited by space       07750018
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07760009
                      FK-TFST-Type-To          Delimited by space       07770018
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07780018
                      TFSR-Type                Delimited by space       07790018
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07800018
                      FK-TFSC-Code-From        Delimited by space       07810018
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07820018
                      FK-TFSC-Code-To          Delimited by space       07830018
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07840018
                      FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM        Delimited by space       07850009
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07860009
                      FK-TFSC-COTY-To          Delimited by space       07870009
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)07880009
               End-String                                               07890009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               07900009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              07910009
                                         To    True                     07920009
      *                                                                 07930009
           End-Evaluate                                                 07940009
      *                                                                 07950009
           .                                                            07960009
      *################################################################.07970009
       F100-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       07980009
      *                                                                 07990009
      * We fill in the host variables for the SQL.                      08000009
      *                                                                 08010009
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       08020009
      *                                                                 08030009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type                               08040009
                                         To    FK-TFST-Type-From        08050009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-F-I-Id                                     08060010
                                         To    FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        08070009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type                            08080009
                                         To    FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM        08090009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code                               08100009
                                         To    FK-TFSC-Code-From        08110009
      *                                                                 08120009
      * .. then To variables                                            08130009
      *                                                                 08140009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type  To    FK-TFST-Type-To          08150009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-F-I-Id      To    FK-OAKO-FINI-To          08160010
           Move  R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type                              08170009
                                         To    FK-TFSC-COTY-To          08180009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code  To    FK-TFSC-Code-To          08190009
           Move  R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type                              08200009
                                         To    TFSR-Type                08210009
      *                                                                 08220009
           If  R115ISR0-In-F-I-No        Not = Spaces                   08230018
           and FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM         =     +0                       08240009
               Move  R115ISR0-In-F-I-No  To    W-Fin-Inst-No            08250018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           08260009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        08270009
           End-If                                                       08280009
      *                                                                 08290009
           If  R115ISR0-In-F-I-No        Not = Spaces                   08300018
           and FK-OAKO-FINI-To           =     +0                       08310009
               Move  R115ISR0-In-F-I-No  To    W-Fin-Inst-No            08320018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           08330009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FINI-TO          08340009
           End-If                                                       08350009
      *                                                                 08360009
           .                                                            08370009
      *################################################################.08380009
       F200-Select-Row                   Section.                       08390009
      *                                                                 08400009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  08410009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     08420009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Select      To    True                     08430009
      *                                                                 08440009
           Call  'F115ISRR'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  08450009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       08460009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      08470009
           End-Call                                                     08480009
      *                                                                 08490009
           Evaluate True                                                08500009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    08510009
               Continue                                                 08520009
      *                                                                 08530009
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 08540009
               Continue                                                 08550015
      *                                                                 08560009
             When other                                                 08570009
               Move  'F201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       08580015
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       08590009
      *                                                                 08600009
           End-Evaluate                                                 08610009
      *                                                                 08620009
           .                                                            08630009
      *################################################################.08640009
       G000-Insert                       Section.                       08650009
      *                                                                 08660009
           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               08670009
           Perform G200-Insert-Row                                      08680009
      *                                                                 08690009
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      08700009
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       08710009
      *                                                                 08720009
           .                                                            08730009
      *################################################################.08740009
       G100-Move-Input-To-DCL            Section.                       08750009
      *                                                                 08760009
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       08770009
      *                                                                 08780009
           Move R115ISR0-From-ST-Type    To    FK-TFST-Type-From        08790009
           Move R115ISR0-F-I-Id          To    FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        08800010
           Move R115ISR0-From-Contr-Type To    FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM        08810009
           Move R115ISR0-From-SC-Code    To    FK-TFSC-Code-From        08820009
      *                                                                 08830009
           Move R115ISR0-To-ST-Type      To    FK-TFST-Type-To          08840009
           Move R115ISR0-F-I-Id          To    FK-OAKO-FINI-To          08850010
           Move R115ISR0-To-Contr-Type   To    FK-TFSC-COTY-To          08860009
           Move R115ISR0-To-SC-Code      To    FK-TFSC-Code-To          08870009
      *                                                                 08880009
           Move R115ISR0-Relation-Type   To    TFSR-Type                08890009
      *                                                                 08900009
           If  R115ISR0-F-I-No           Not = Spaces                   08910018
           and FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM         =     +0                       08920009
               Move  R115ISR0-F-I-No     To    W-Fin-Inst-No            08930018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           08940009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        08950009
           End-If                                                       08960009
      *                                                                 08970009
           If  R115ISR0-F-I-No           Not = Spaces                   08980018
           and FK-OAKO-FINI-To           =     +0                       08990009
               Move  R115ISR0-F-I-No     To    W-Fin-Inst-No            09000018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           09010009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FINI-TO          09020009
           End-If                                                       09030009
      *                                                                 09040009
           .                                                            09050009
      *################################################################.09060009
       G200-Insert-Row                   Section.                       09070009
      *                                                                 09080009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  09090009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     09100009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Insert      To    True                     09110009
      *                                                                 09120009
           Call  'F115ISRU'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  09130009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       09140009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      09150009
           End-Call                                                     09160009
      *                                                                 09170009
           Evaluate True                                                09180009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    09190009
               Continue                                                 09200009
      *                                                                 09210009
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 09220009
               Continue                                                 09230009
      *                                                                 09240009
             When other                                                 09250009
               Move  'G201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       09260009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       09270009
      *                                                                 09280009
           End-Evaluate                                                 09290009
      *                                                                 09300009
           .                                                            09310009
      *################################################################.09320009
       H000-Update                       Section.                       09330009
      *                                                                 09340009
           Perform H100-Check-Qualification                             09350009
           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               09360009
      *                                                                 09370009
           Perform H200-Update-Row                                      09380009
      *                                                                 09390009
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      09400009
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       09410009
      *                                                                 09420009
           .                                                            09430009
      *################################################################.09440009
       H100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       09450009
      *                                                                 09460009
      * Handling ST-Type                                                09470009
      *                                                                 09480009
           Evaluate True                                                09490009
             When R115ISR0-From-ST-Type  Not = Space                    09500009
               Continue                                                 09510009
                                                                        09520009
             When R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type                              09530009
                                         Not = Space                    09540009
               Move R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type                            09550009
                                         To    R115ISR0-From-ST-Type    09560009
                                                                        09570009
             When other                                                 09580009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    09590009
               Move  'TF-TYPE-MISSING'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  09600009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               09610009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              09620009
                                         To    True                     09630009
                                                                        09640009
           End-Evaluate                                                 09650009
      *                                                                 09660009
      * Handling Fin-Inst-From                                          09670009
      *                                                                 09680009
           Evaluate True                                                09690009
             When R115ISR0-F-I-Id        Not = +0                       09700010
               Continue                                                 09710009
                                                                        09720009
             When R115ISR0-In-F-I-Id     Not = +0                       09730018
               Move R115ISR0-In-F-I-Id   To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          09740018
                                                                        09750009
             When R115ISR0-F-I-No        Not = Spaces                   09760018
               Move R115ISR0-F-I-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            09770018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           09780009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          09790010
                                                                        09800009
             When R115ISR0-In-F-I-No     Not = Spaces                   09810018
               Move R115ISR0-In-F-I-No   To    W-Fin-Inst-No            09820018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           09830009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          09840010
                                                                        09850009
             When other                                                 09860009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    09870009
               Move  'TF-FININST-MISSING'                               09880009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  09890009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               09900009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              09910009
                                         To    True                     09920009
                                                                        09930009
           End-Evaluate                                                 09940009
      *                                                                 09950009
      * Handling Contr-Type                                             09960009
      *                                                                 09970009
           Evaluate True                                                09980009
             When R115ISR0-From-Contr-Type Not = Space                  09990009
               Continue                                                 10000009
                                                                        10010009
             When R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type                           10020009
                                         Not = Space                    10030009
               Move R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type                         10040009
                                         To    R115ISR0-From-Contr-Type 10050009
                                                                        10060009
             When other                                                 10070009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10080009
               Move  'TF-CONTRTY-MISSING'                               10090009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10100009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               10110009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              10120009
                                         To    True                     10130009
                                                                        10140009
           End-Evaluate                                                 10150009
      *                                                                 10160009
      * Handling SC-COde                                                10170009
      *                                                                 10180009
           Evaluate True                                                10190009
             When R115ISR0-From-SC-Code  Not = Space                    10200009
               Continue                                                 10210009
                                                                        10220009
             When R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code                              10230009
                                         Not = Space                    10240009
               Move R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code                            10250009
                                         To    R115ISR0-From-SC-Code    10260009
                                                                        10270009
             When other                                                 10280009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10290009
               Move  'TF-CODE-MISSING'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10300009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               10310009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              10320009
                                         To    True                     10330009
                                                                        10340009
           End-Evaluate                                                 10350009
      *                                                                 10360009
      * Handling ST-Type   -     T O    -                               10370009
      *                                                                 10380009
           Evaluate True                                                10390009
             When R115ISR0-To-ST-Type    Not = Space                    10400009
               Continue                                                 10410009
                                                                        10420009
             When R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type Not = Space                    10430009
               Move R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type                              10440009
                                         To    R115ISR0-To-ST-Type      10450009
                                                                        10460009
             When other                                                 10470009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10480009
               Move  'TF-TYPE-MISSING'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10490009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               10500009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              10510009
                                         To    True                     10520009
                                                                        10530009
           End-Evaluate                                                 10540009
      *                                                                 10550009
      * Handling Fin-Inst- To                                           10560009
      *                                                                 10570009
           Evaluate True                                                10580009
             When R115ISR0-F-I-Id        Not = +0                       10590010
               Continue                                                 10600009
                                                                        10610009
             When R115ISR0-In-F-I-Id     Not = +0                       10620018
               Move R115ISR0-In-F-I-Id   To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          10630018
                                                                        10640009
             When R115ISR0-In-F-I-No     Not = Spaces                   10650018
               Move R115ISR0-In-F-I-No   To    W-Fin-Inst-No            10660018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           10670009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          10680010
                                                                        10690009
             When R115ISR0-In-F-I-No     Not = Spaces                   10700018
               Move R115ISR0-In-F-I-No   To    W-Fin-Inst-No            10710018
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           10720009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          10730010
                                                                        10740009
             When other                                                 10750009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10760009
               Move  'TF-FININST-MISSING'                               10770009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10780009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               10790009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              10800009
                                         To    True                     10810009
                                                                        10820009
           End-Evaluate                                                 10830009
      *                                                                 10840009
      * Handling Contr-Type                                             10850009
      *                                                                 10860009
           Evaluate True                                                10870009
             When R115ISR0-To-Contr-Type Not = Space                    10880009
               Continue                                                 10890009
                                                                        10900009
             When R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type                             10910009
                                         Not = Space                    10920009
               Move R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type                           10930009
                                         To    R115ISR0-To-Contr-Type   10940009
                                                                        10950009
             When other                                                 10960009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10970009
               Move  'TF-CONTRTY-MISSING'                               10980009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10990009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               11000009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              11010009
                                         To    True                     11020009
                                                                        11030009
           End-Evaluate                                                 11040009
      *                                                                 11050009
      * Handling SC-COde                                                11060009
      *                                                                 11070009
           Evaluate True                                                11080009
             When R115ISR0-To-SC-Code    Not = Space                    11090009
               Continue                                                 11100009
                                                                        11110009
             When R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code Not = Space                    11120009
               Move R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code                              11130009
                                         To    R115ISR0-To-SC-Code      11140009
                                                                        11150009
             When other                                                 11160009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    11170009
               Move  'TF-CODE-MISSING'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  11180009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               11190009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              11200009
                                         To    True                     11210009
                                                                        11220009
           End-Evaluate                                                 11230009
      *                                                                 11240009
      * Handling Relation-Code                                          11250009
      *                                                                 11260009
           Evaluate True                                                11270009
             When R115ISR0-Relation-Type Not = Space                    11280009
               Continue                                                 11290009
                                                                        11300009
             When R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type                             11310009
                                         Not = Space                    11320009
               Move R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type                           11330009
                                         To    R115ISR0-Relation-Type   11340009
                                                                        11350009
             When other                                                 11360009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    11370009
               Move  'TF-RELATION-MISSING'                              11380009
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  11390009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               11400009
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              11410009
                                         To    True                     11420009
                                                                        11430009
           End-Evaluate                                                 11440009
      *                                                                 11450009
           .                                                            11460009
      *################################################################.11470009
       H200-Update-Row                   Section.                       11480009
      *                                                                 11490009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  11500009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     11510009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Update      To    True                     11520009
      *                                                                 11530009
           Call  'F115ISRU'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  11540009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       11550009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11560009
           End-Call                                                     11570009
      *                                                                 11580009
           Evaluate True                                                11590009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    11600009
               Continue                                                 11610009
      *                                                                 11620009
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 11630009
               Continue                                                 11640009
      *                                                                 11650009
             When other                                                 11660009
               Move  'H201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       11670009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11680009
      *                                                                 11690009
           End-Evaluate                                                 11700009
      *                                                                 11710009
           .                                                            11720009
      *################################################################.11730009
       I000-Delete                       Section.                       11740009
      *                                                                 11750009
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           11760009
           Perform I200-Delete-Row                                      11770009
      *                                                                 11780009
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      11790009
      *                                                                 11800009
           .                                                            11810009
      *################################################################.11820009
       I200-Delete-Row                   Section.                       11830009
      *                                                                 11840009
           Initialize                          R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  11850009
           Set   R115ISRS-Version        To    True                     11860009
           Set   R115ISRS-In-Delete      To    True                     11870009
      *                                                                 11880009
           Call  'F115ISRU'              Using R115ISRS-SQL-Submodules  11890009
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       11900009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11910009
           End-Call                                                     11920009
      *                                                                 11930009
           Evaluate True                                                11940009
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    11950009
               Continue                                                 11960009
      *                                                                 11970009
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 11980009
               Continue                                                 11990009
      *                                                                 12000009
             When other                                                 12010009
               Move  'I201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       12020009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       12030009
      *                                                                 12040009
           End-Evaluate                                                 12050009
      *                                                                 12060009
           .                                                            12070009
      *################################################################.12080009
       J000-Get-Columns                  Section.                       12090009
      *                                                                 12100009
           Perform J100-Move-DCL-To-Output                              12110009
      *                                                                 12120009
           .                                                            12130009
      *################################################################.12140009
       J100-Move-DCL-To-Output           Section.                       12150009
      *                                                                 12160009
           Move  FK-TFST-Type-From       To    R115ISR0-From-ST-Type    12170009
           Move  FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM       To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          12180010
           Move  FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM       To    R115ISR0-From-Contr-Type 12190009
           Move  FK-TFSC-Code-From       To    R115ISR0-From-SC-Code    12200009
      *                                                                 12210009
           Move  FK-TFST-Type-To         To    R115ISR0-To-ST-Type      12220009
           Move  FK-OAKO-FINI-To         To    R115ISR0-F-I-Id          12230010
           Move  FK-TFSC-COTY-To         To    R115ISR0-To-Contr-Type   12240009
           Move  FK-TFSC-Code-To         To    R115ISR0-To-SC-Code      12250009
      *                                                                 12260009
           Move  TFSR-Type               To    R115ISR0-Relation-Type   12270009
      *                                                                 12280009
           Move  FK-OAKO-FINI-From       To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            12290013
           Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                               12300013
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No           To    R115ISR0-F-I-No          12310013
      *                                                                 12320013
      * Info about the cursor:                                          12330009
      *                                                                 12340009
           Move  WC-Row-No               To    R115ISR0-Out-Row-No      12350009
           Move  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows     To    R115ISR0-Out-Total-Rows  12360009
      *                                                                 12370009
           .                                                            12380009
      *################################################################.12390009
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       12400009
      *                                                                 12410009
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      12420009
      *                                                                 12430009
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        12440009
      *                                                                 12450009
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12460009
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 12470009
             Then                                                       12480009
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         12490009
      *        we start on the beginning.                               12500009
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       12510009
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               12520009
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12530009
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               12540009
               End-If                                                   12550009
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   12560009
             Else                                                       12570009
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               12580009
           End-If                                                       12590009
      *                                                                 12600009
      * We store the identification.                                    12610009
      *                                                                 12620009
KUTT  *    Move  FK-TFST-Type-From       To    WS-DB2-From-Type         12630018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12640018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM       To    WS-DB2-From-F-I-Id       12650018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12660018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM       To    WS-DB2-From-Contr-Type   12670018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12680018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-TFSC-Code-From       To    WS-DB2-From-Code         12690018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12700018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-TFST-Type-To         To    WS-DB2-To-Type           12710018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12720018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-OAKO-FINI-To         To    WS-DB2-To-F-I-Id         12730018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12740018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-TFSC-COTY-To         To    WS-DB2-To-Contr-Type     12750018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12760018
KUTT  *    Move  FK-TFSC-Code-To         To    WS-DB2-To-Code           12770018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12780018
KUTT  *    Move  TFSR-Type               To    WS-DB2-Rel-Type          12790018
KUTT  *                                                     (Ind-WS-Put)12800018
KUTT  *                                                                 12810018
           Move  FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM       To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id       12820018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12830018
           Move  FK-TFST-Type-From       To    WS-DB2-From-Type         12840018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12850018
           Move  FK-TFST-Type-To         To    WS-DB2-To-Type           12860018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12870018
           Move  TFSR-Type               To    WS-DB2-Rel-Type          12880018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12890018
           Move  FK-TFSC-Code-From       To    WS-DB2-From-Code         12900018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12910018
           Move  FK-TFSC-Code-To         To    WS-DB2-To-Code           12920018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12930018
           Move  FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM       To    WS-DB2-From-Contr-Type   12940018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12950018
           Move  FK-TFSC-COTY-To         To    WS-DB2-To-Contr-Type     12960018
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12970018
      *                                                                 12980018
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  12990018
      *                                                                 13000009
           Evaluate True                                                13010009
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       13020009
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               13030009
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel       13040009
                                         To    WD-Length                13050009
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    13060009
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  13070009
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)13080009
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)13090009
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               13100009
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       13110009
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       13120009
      *                                                                 13130009
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 13140009
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      13150009
                                         To    True                     13160009
      *                                                                 13170009
             When other                                                 13180009
               Move  DCLTF-Sys-Code-Rel                                 13190009
                                         To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)13200009
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           13210009
                                         To    True                     13220009
      *                                                                 13230009
           End-Evaluate                                                 13240009
      *                                                                 13250009
           .                                                            13260009
      *################################################################.13270009
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       13280009
      *                                                                 13290009
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       13300009
                   From  +1              By    +1                       13310009
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13320009
KUTT  *            or  ( WS-DB2-From-Type (Ind-WS)                      13330018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFST-Type-From        13340018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-From-F-I-Id     (Ind-WS)                13350018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        13360018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-From-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                13370018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM        13380018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-From-Code (Ind-WS)                      13390018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-Code-From        13400018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-Type (Ind-WS)                        13410018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFST-Type-To          13420018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-F-I-Id     (Ind-WS)                  13430018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-OAKO-FINI-To          13440018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                  13450018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-COTY-To          13460018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-Code (Ind-WS)                        13470018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-Code-To          13480018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-Rel-Type (Ind-WS)                       13490018
KUTT  *                                  =     TFSR-Type )              13500018
KUTT  *                                                                 13510018
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id     (Ind-WS)                13520018
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        13530018
                   and   WS-DB2-From-Type (Ind-WS)                      13540018
                                         =     FK-TFST-Type-From        13550018
                   and   WS-DB2-To-Type (Ind-WS)                        13560018
                                         =     FK-TFST-Type-To          13570018
                   and   WS-DB2-Rel-Type (Ind-WS)                       13580018
                                         =     TFSR-Type                13590018
                   and   WS-DB2-From-Code (Ind-WS)                      13600018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-Code-From        13610018
                   and   WS-DB2-To-Code (Ind-WS)                        13620018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-Code-To          13630018
                   and   WS-DB2-From-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                13640018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM        13650018
                   and   WS-DB2-To-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                  13660018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-COTY-To )        13670018
           End-Perform                                                  13680018
      *                                                                 13690018
           .                                                            13700018
      *################################################################*13710009
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       13720009
      *                                                                 13730009
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       13740009
                   From  +1              By    +1                       13750009
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13760009
KUTT  *            or  ( WS-DB2-From-Type (Ind-WS)                      13770018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFST-Type-From        13780018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-From-F-I-Id     (Ind-WS)                13790018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-OAKO-FINI-From        13800018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-From-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                13810018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-COTY-From        13820018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-From-Code (Ind-WS)                      13830018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-Code-From        13840018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-Type (Ind-WS)                        13850018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFST-Type-To          13860018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-F-I-Id     (Ind-WS)                  13870018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-OAKO-FINI-To          13880018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                  13890018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-COTY-To          13900018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-To-Code (Ind-WS)                        13910018
KUTT  *                                  =     FK-TFSC-Code-To          13920018
KUTT  *            and   WS-DB2-Rel-Type (Ind-WS)                       13930018
KUTT  *                                  =     TFSR-Type )              13940018
KUTT  *                                                                 13950018
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id     (Ind-WS)                13960018
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FINI-FROM        13970018
                   and   WS-DB2-From-Type (Ind-WS)                      13980018
                                         =     FK-TFST-Type-From        13990018
                   and   WS-DB2-To-Type (Ind-WS)                        14000018
                                         =     FK-TFST-Type-To          14010018
                   and   WS-DB2-Rel-Type (Ind-WS)                       14020018
                                         =     TFSR-Type                14030018
                   and   WS-DB2-From-Code (Ind-WS)                      14040018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-Code-From        14050018
                   and   WS-DB2-To-Code (Ind-WS)                        14060018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-Code-To          14070018
                   and   WS-DB2-From-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                14080018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-COTY-FROM        14090018
                   and   WS-DB2-To-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                  14100018
                                         =     FK-TFSC-COTY-To )        14110018
           End-Perform                                                  14120009
      *                                                                 14130009
           Evaluate True                                                14140009
             When Ind-WS                 >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         14150009
               Continue                                                 14160009
      *                                                                 14170009
             When other                                                 14180009
               Initialize                      WS-DB2-Row (Ind-WS)      14190009
      *                                                                 14200009
           End-Evaluate                                                 14210009
      *                                                                 14220009
           .                                                            14230009
      *################################################################*14240009
       N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID            Section.                       14250009
      *                                                                 14260009
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         14270009
      *                                                                 14280009
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     14290009
           or  R5879010-In-Konsernnr     Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         14300009
      *                                                                 14310009
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         14320009
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     14330009
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     14340009
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr    14350009
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         14360009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      14370009
               End-Call                                                 14380009
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               14390009
                   Move  'N101'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14400009
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14410009
               End-If                                                   14420009
      *                                                                 14430009
           End-If                                                       14440009
      *                                                                 14450009
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id                              14460009
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            14470009
      *                                                                 14480009
           .                                                            14490009
      *################################################################*14500009
       N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No            Section.                       14510009
      *                                                                 14520009
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     14530009
           or  R5879010-In-Konsern-ID    Not = W-Fin-Inst-ID            14540009
      *                                                                 14550009
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         14560009
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     14570009
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     14580009
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R5879010-In-Konsern-ID   14590009
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         14600009
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      14610009
               End-Call                                                 14620009
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               14630009
                   Move  'N201'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14640009
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14650009
               End-If                                                   14660009
      *                                                                 14670009
           End-If                                                       14680009
      *                                                                 14690009
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsernnummer                           14700009
                                         To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         14710009
           Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr        To    W-Fin-Inst-No            14720009
      *                                                                 14730009
           .                                                            14740009
      *################################################################*14750009
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       14760009
      *                                                                 14770009
      * Version control.                                                14780009
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         14790009
      *                                                                 14800009
           Set   R115ISR0-Version        To    True                     14810009
           Move  Length                  Of    R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    14820009
                                         To    W-IO-Length              14830009
      *                                                                 14840009
           Evaluate True                                                14850009
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ISR0-Version-No      14860009
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            14870009
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              14880009
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      14890009
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            14900009
      *                                                                 14910009
             When Other                                                 14920009
               Call  'F115I999'                                         14930009
                   Using By Content      'F115ISR0 '                    14940009
                                         'INPUT '                       14950009
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  14960009
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  14970009
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            14980009
               End-Call                                                 14990009
      *                                                                 15000009
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                15010009
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       15020009
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   15030009
               End-If                                                   15040009
      *                                                                 15050009
           End-Evaluate                                                 15060009
      *                                                                 15070009
           .                                                            15080009
      *################################################################*15090009
       ZO00-Conv-Output-Version          Section.                       15100009
      *                                                                 15110009
      * Version control.                                                15120009
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         15130009
      *                                                                 15140009
           Evaluate True                                                15150009
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ISR0-Version-No      15160009
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            15170009
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              15180009
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            15190009
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)15200009
      *                                                                 15210009
             When Other                                                 15220009
               Call  'F115I999'                                         15230009
                   Using By Content      'F115ISR0 '                    15240009
                                         'OUTPUT '                      15250009
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  15260009
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  15270009
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            15280009
               End-Call                                                 15290009
      *                                                                 15300009
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                15310009
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       15320009
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   15330009
               End-If                                                   15340009
      *                                                                 15350009
           End-Evaluate                                                 15360009
      *                                                                 15370009
           .                                                            15380009
      *################################################################*15390009
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       15400009
      *                                                                 15410009
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     15420009
      *                                                                 15430009
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    15440009
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  15450009
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             15460009
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     15470009
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        15480009
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     15490009
           End-If                                                       15500009
      *                                                                 15510009
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    15520009
           End-Call                                                     15530009
      *                                                                 15540009
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               15550009
                                         To    R7919999-Message         15560009
      *                                                                 15570009
           .                                                            15580009
      *################################################################*15590009
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       15600009
      *                                                                 15610009
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  15620009
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                15630009
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      15640009
           End-If                                                       15650009
      *                                                                 15660009
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      15670009
      *                                                                 15680009
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          15690009
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      15700009
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )15710009
               Move  'F115ISR0'          To    R7919999-Module-Name     15720009
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)15730009
               Move  R7919999-Paragraph  To    R7919999-Module-Para     15740009
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)15750009
           End-If                                                       15760009
      *                                                                 15770009
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    TRUE                     15780009
      *                                                                 15790009
           Goback.                                                      15800009
